<title>FRANCE: Canalsatellite eyes 500,000 subscribers by yr-end.</title>
<headline>Canalsatellite eyes 500,000 subscribers by yr-end.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canalsatellite, the satellite TV unit of French pay television firm Canal Plus, will have 400,000 subscribers next week and exceed the 500,000 threshold at the end of the year, chairman Bruno Delecour told the company's annual general meeting.</p>
<p>Canalsatellite was launched in April last year and had 220,000 subscribers at the end of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
